{"id":2495150,"sci":"Struthio camelus","inatName":"Struthio camelus","ar":"نعامة شائعة","arAlt":[],"en":"Common Ostrich","local":null,"localNote":null,"group":null,"hunting":false,"fam":"Struthionidae","famAr":null,"ord":"Struthioniformes","ordAr":"نعاميات","iucn":"LC","status":"winter","months":[2,4,2,4,0,0,0,1,4,2,1,5],"presence":[0.41,0.68,0.32,0.63,0,0,0,0.3,0.68,0.28,0.17,1],"n":35,"inat":20526,"inatN":16316,"ebird":"ostric2","summary":"النعام (الاسم العلمي: Struthio)، جنس من الطيور الكبيرة التي لا تطير. وهي أثقل الطيور الحية، وتضع أكبر بيض مقارنة بأي حيوان بري حي. ولديها القدرة على الجري بسرعة 70 كم / ساعة، فهي أسرع الطيور على الأرض. يتم تربيتها في جميع أنحاء العالم، مع وجود صناعات لها مهمة في الفلبين وناميبيا. جلد النعام سلعة مربحة، ويستخدم الريش الكبير لتزيين أغطية الرأس في الاحتفالات. وقد استخدم البشر بيض النعام منذ آلاف السنين.","summaryEn":null,"wiki":"https://ar.wikipedia.org/wiki/نعامة","arWiki":"https://ar.wikipedia.org/wiki/%D9%86%D8%B9%D8%A7%D9%85_%D8%B4%D8%A7%D8%A6%D8%B9","photos":[{"u":"https://inaturalist-open-data.s3.amazonaws.com/photos/256201078/{s}.jpg","a":"(c) Steve Murray, some rights reserved (CC BY-NC), uploaded by Steve Murray","lic":"cc-by-nc"},{"u":"https://inaturalist-open-data.s3.amazonaws.com/photos/28859999/{s}.jpeg","a":"(c) quiteaquail, some rights reserved (CC BY-NC)","lic":"cc-by-nc"},{"u":"https://inaturalist-open-data.s3.amazonaws.com/photos/13605579/{s}.jpeg","a":"(c) copper, some rights reserved (CC BY-NC), uploaded by copper","lic":"cc-by-nc"},{"u":"https://inaturalist-open-data.s3.amazonaws.com/photos/177279004/{s}.jpeg","a":"(c) Tom Heath, some rights reserved (CC BY-NC), uploaded by Tom Heath","lic":"cc-by-nc"},{"u":"https://inaturalist-open-data.s3.amazonaws.com/photos/13605642/{s}.jpeg","a":"(c) copper, some rights reserved (CC BY-NC), uploaded by copper","lic":"cc-by-nc"},{"u":"https://inaturalist-open-data.s3.amazonaws.com/photos/13605564/{s}.jpeg","a":"(c) copper, some rights reserved (CC BY-NC), uploaded by copper